-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Ideas adapted (re-implemented, no code copied)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Basalt (https://github.com/jesdga95/basalt), MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Jesus Gulfo: slot-budget alignment
  (Basalt PR #120 -> Speedy J13), PSI-driven cache shedding (PR #113 -> C4), the pinned bounce buffer (PR #66 -> C3,
  later dropped), per-expert pool readiness (J02, rejected). License text: licenses/Basalt-MIT.txt.
- StrataFast (a Strata fork with a second-GPU prompt split): studied for the dual-GPU roadmap; no code taken.
- architectds/Strata branch "best" (MIT): INT8 tensor-core (IMMA) prompt attention. It is already in upstream
  Strata as STRATA_PROMPT_ATTN_IMMA; Speedy only turns it on by default.
- Cloudflare "Code Mode" (pattern only): tools/codemode_mcp.py.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Not bundled
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- gpu-unlock (https://github.com/Zagitta/gpu-unlock): an optional, separately installed third-party kernel module
  used on the reference machine. No part of it is in this repository; it keeps its own license.
  See docs/GPU-UNLOCK.md.
- Model weights (Qwen3.8-Flash-Next and its quantisations) are not part of this repository and keep their own
  licenses.

The Speedy logo (docs/assets/speedy-logo.webp, docs/assets/speedy-logo-small.png) and the older mascot and icon
(docs/assets/logo.svg, docs/assets/icon.svg) are artwork made for this project.

